    description: "Residual found by the 2026-11-02 awaits_bakeoff_validation drain while validating WI-vodin (record: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/bakeoff_queue_11022026/VERDICTS.md). WI-vodin's claim moved: pretix's id_format validation violations fell 118 -> 21. All 21 that remain are one shape: `colon_in_name_slot` on JavaScript symbols named from an event string, e.g. javascript:src/pretix/static/fabric/fabric.js:28516-28516:mouse:up:function and ...:28826-28826:mouse:move:function. The ':' in the name shifts the right-anchored id slots; the validator's own message says to route the name through sanitize_id_name_segment / make_symbol_id. Not yet traced to the emitting branch in the JS analyzer (a property key such as 'mouse:up': function() {...} is the likely source). Repro: hypergumbo survey on pretix (ALL_REPOS/repos_Apr12_2026/pretix), read validation_report.violations where validator_class == id_format."  # 6b4a
